\section{Research}
\runsubsection{\href{https://control.ee.ethz.ch}{Automatic Control Lab}}
\descript{| Master's Student}
\location{Sep 2017 – Oct 2018 | Zurich, Switzerland}
\begin{tightemize}
\item Worked with Prof. Dr. John Lygeros and Dr. Annika Eichler on Human-in-the-Loop building controls project combining Model Predictive Control and online Bayesian ML.
\item Built Python library to model building thermodynamics and run coupled model training and simulation experiments on HPC cluster.
\item Developed online Bayesian Linear Discriminant Analysis (LDA) classifier for thermal comfort using PyMC3 with an MCMC algorithm.
\item Derived predictive model of occupancy probability in Python using Markov chains and change point detection algorithm.
\end{tightemize}
